# Provenance and attribution

This repository is a personal fork under `akmaldju`, kept under our own control.

It is built from:

- **Original project** — `opencode-antigravity-auth` by Jens and NoeFabris
  (https://github.com/NoeFabris/opencode-antigravity-auth), MIT licensed, now archived.
- **Community revival (vendored)** — the OpenCode v2 port, current-backend
  compatibility fixes, and much of the applied source in this fork are adapted
  from https://github.com/JoshRob297/opencode-antigravity-auth (MIT), vendored
  at commit `9ffdb3e` and no longer used as a runtime dependency.

The original MIT license and copyright notices are preserved in
`LICENSE`. Modifications made in this fork are released under the same MIT
license.
